flowchart TB
  Seller[商家Web后台 Vue3] --> Gateway[HTTPS Gateway]
  Gateway --> API[Spring Boot API 模块化单体]
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis)]
  API --> MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  MQ --> Worker[独立Worker]
  Worker --> AD[Provider Adapter Layer]
  AD --> Mock[Mock Providers]
  AD -.审批后.-> Douyin[抖店官方API]
  AD -.审批后.-> Taobao[淘宝官方API]
  AD -.审批后.-> A1688[1688官方分销/支付通道]
  AD -.合作渠道待证实.-> PDD[拼多多受控适配器]
